# Wendi's Level 3: Rising Water Escape
# A ruptured pipe in the lowest chamber steadily floods the tower. Climb the
# zig-zag route, use both swing-door buttons to buy a little time, then trigger
# the top exit switch before the water catches the player.
script water_escape
bounds 0 0 1600 900
playerStart 1330 782

# The continuous leaking pipe fills this whole connected tower from the bottom.
# At 22 vertical pixels per second, it takes roughly half a minute to reach the
# upper escape floor, leaving room for one recovery attempt without stalling.
water 32 28 1536 822 6 0.04 1
valveFluidFill 0 0.96 22

# Tower shell.
solid 0 0 1600 28
solid 0 28 32 872
solid 1568 28 32 872
solid 32 850 1536 50

# Bottom course: start at the leak, cross left, and climb the first ladder.
platform 760 750 760 30
ladder 790 600 48 150
platform 300 600 920 30
enemy 960 560 34 40 820 1130 72
directionalSpikeHazard up 540 574 105 26
labelSized 1240 798 20 RUPTURED PIPE

# The first button swings a wooden door down. It is a temporary flood brake,
# with a deliberate gap at its hinged end.
button 1080 584 76 16
trapDoor 1020 600 170 24 0
buttonTrapDoor 0 0 76 150
chain 1118 580 1105 526 16 0.68 1 1

# Middle course: run right, dodge the acid channel, then climb again.
ladder 1130 450 48 150
platform 530 450 830 30
directionalSpikeHazard up 780 424 116 26
enemy 620 410 34 40 575 760 66
labelSized 796 405 18 ACID CHANNEL

# The second door creates the final delay before the upper escape floor.
button 900 434 76 16
trapDoor 820 450 170 24 0
buttonTrapDoor 1 1 76 150
chain 938 430 905 376 16 0.68 1 1

# Upper course and exit control. The player must cross back left after latching
# the exit switch, then run through the raised gate.
ladder 660 300 48 150
platform 220 300 980 30
enemy 980 260 34 40 880 1120 72
platform 32 150 700 30
ladder 650 150 48 150
button 450 284 76 16
buttonExit 2
exit 88 30 96 120
labelSized 385 245 20 EXIT RELEASE
labelSized 95 108 24 EXIT
